1
00:00:04,37 --> 00:00:08,60
Oh,here's little Ben falling asleep.
哦,小本本困了

2
00:00:08,80 --> 00:00:13,43
A little bit later. Is he gonna sleep?
等一下,他就要睡著了

3
00:00:13,64 --> 00:00:18,48
Is he gonna sleep? Is he gonna?
他要睡了嗎?要睡了嗎?

4
00:00:18,78 --> 00:00:21,51
Yep,out like a light!
是的,就是這個了!

5
00:00:21,88 --> 00:00:25,34
This sure trumps the "Has he pooped?" series.
這一定是強普的「他筋疲力竭了?」系列

6
00:00:25,55 --> 00:00:27,38
Ross,we love him,okay?
羅斯,我們愛他,ok?

7
00:00:27,59 --> 00:00:30,65
But right now he's just a little fat guy.
但是現在他只是一個裸體的胖小伙

8
00:00:30,86 --> 00:00:32,38
How excited can we get?
我們實在是太興奮了?

9
00:00:34,93 --> 00:00:37,96
-What you got? -400 pictures of Ben on a rug.
-你拿的什麼? -本墊子下的400張照片

10
00:00:38,17 --> 00:00:41,16
-Oh,my God! -Let me see!
-哦,天哪! -讓我看看!

11
00:00:42,44 --> 00:00:44,63
The One Where Rachel Finds Out
六人行 第1季 第24集 瑞秋恍然大悟

12
00:00:46,26 --> 00:00:55,00
-=BT之家DRM小組 http://bbs.btbbt.com=- 榮譽出品 河馬根據網絡字幕微調製作

13
00:01:27,72 --> 00:01:30,01
Here's little Ben nodding off.
小本本睡著了

14
00:01:30,22 --> 00:01:32,95
Look at Aunt Monica's little boy!
看摩妮卡姑姑的小男孩

15
00:01:33,15 --> 00:01:36,92
-Look,he's got Ross haircut. -Let me see.
-瞧,他有羅斯的髮型. -我看看

16
00:01:37,33 --> 00:01:40,39
Oh,God! Is he just the sweetest thing?
天啊,真可愛

17
00:01:40,66 --> 00:01:43,89
You must just wanna kiss him all over.
你一定想吻遍他

18
00:01:47,57 --> 00:01:49,94
That would be nice.
那感覺一定很好

19
00:01:53,04 --> 00:01:54,13
-Pardon? -Nothing.
-什麼? -沒事

20
00:01:54,34 --> 00:01:56,97
Just a little extra air in my mouth.
只是嘴裡有多餘的空氣

21
00:02:02,02 --> 00:02:05,51
Chan,can you help me out? I'll pay you back.
錢德,願意幫我嗎?我保證一定會還的

22
00:02:05,72 --> 00:02:10,18
Right. Including the waffles last week,you now owe me...
好,包括上星期的威化餅,你現在欠我

23
00:02:10,59 --> 00:02:12,82
... 1 7 jillion dollars.
17大洋

24
00:02:13,50 --> 00:02:18,06
-Really,I'll pay you back this time. -Where's this money coming from?
-真的,這一次我真的會還 -錢將從哪兒來?

25
00:02:18,27 --> 00:02:21,72
I'm helping out at the NYU Med School with research.
我正幫紐約大學醫學院做一些研究

26
00:02:21,94 --> 00:02:23,56
What kind of research?
什麼研究?

27
00:02:25,54 --> 00:02:27,60
Just,you know,science.
只不過,你知道的,科學研究

28
00:02:28,31 --> 00:02:29,94
Science.
科學?

29
00:02:31,85 --> 00:02:34,37
Yeah,I think I've heard of that.
我想我聽說過

30
00:02:36,35 --> 00:02:39,15
It's a fertility study.
生殖研究

31
00:02:39,59 --> 00:02:44,68
Joey,please tell me you're only donating your time.
喬伊,請告訴我你只貢獻時間

32
00:02:45,93 --> 00:02:49,06
Actually,a little more than that.
事實上,比這稍微多一點點

33
00:02:50,00 --> 00:02:54,56
Thank you,God. This will bring us so much joy.
謝謝,上帝.這會給我們帶來更多笑料

34
00:02:55,00 --> 00:02:57,67
Come on,it's not that big a deal.
拜託,這沒什麼了不起的

35
00:02:57,87 --> 00:03:00,43
I just go down there every other day...
我只是兩天去一趟

36
00:03:00,64 --> 00:03:03,81
...and make my contribution to the project.
對此計劃貢獻己力

37
00:03:04,01 --> 00:03:06,78
But at the end of two weeks, I get $700!
但兩周後我就有七百元

38
00:03:07,95 --> 00:03:11,21
You're gonna be making money hand over fist.
你將「靠手」賺錢

39
00:03:13,29 --> 00:03:15,31
That's funny. Very funny.
這太有趣了,非常有趣

40
00:03:15,86 --> 00:03:21,30
This is great. I actually know somebody who loves what they do.
太好了,我真的知道有人非常喜歡他們做的

41
00:03:22,93 --> 00:03:27,56
But what do you do to unwind after a tough day at work?
但是一天的辛苦工作後,你怎麼放鬆自己呢?

42
00:03:30,34 --> 00:03:32,83
Okay,we got the coleslaw and buns.
我們有酸捲心菜絲,小麵包

43
00:03:33,04 --> 00:03:37,44
The ground-up flesh of formerly cute cows and turkeys.
還有絞牛肉及火雞肉

44
00:03:38,68 --> 00:03:41,65
I just love barbecuing with you.
我喜歡和你一起出去烤肉

45
00:03:42,42 --> 00:03:44,41
Men are here!
男人回來了

46
00:03:49,59 --> 00:03:51,08
We make fire.
我們生火

47
00:03:53,23 --> 00:03:54,72
Cook meat.
煮肉

48
00:03:54,93 --> 00:03:57,92
Put out fire by peeing, no get invited back.
然後撒尿熄火,從此成為拒絕往來戶

49
00:03:58,13 --> 00:03:59,50
Cute.
真逗

50
00:03:59,70 --> 00:04:02,67
-Melanie called. She'll be late. -Okay.
-瑪蓮妮來電說她會遲到. -好

51
00:04:02,87 --> 00:04:07,97
How are things going? Is she becoming your "special someone"?
你們倆進展得如何?她會成為你的女友?

52
00:04:09,38 --> 00:04:12,28
I don't know. She's pretty great.
我不知道,她很好

53
00:04:12,48 --> 00:04:16,25
What does she think of your little science project?
是嗎?她對你的研究計劃有何感想?

54
00:04:17,05 --> 00:04:21,35
You think I'd tell a girl I like that I'm also seeing a cup?
你認為我會告訴她,我也和「杯子」約會?

55
00:04:24,46 --> 00:04:25,95
Man's got a point.
男人是有重點的

56
00:04:26,23 --> 00:04:29,86
The tough thing is, she really wants to have sex.
麻煩的是她想和我做愛

57
00:04:30,06 --> 00:04:31,96
Crazy bitch.
這娘兒們瘋了

58
00:04:37,14 --> 00:04:40,67
I got a week left to go. According to the rules...
此計劃我只剩一星期,根據規定

59
00:04:40,91 --> 00:04:46,44
... I can't conduct personal experiments,if you know what I mean.
如果我想拿到錢,我就不能做「個人」實驗 如果你們懂我意思的話

60
00:04:46,65 --> 00:04:50,31
Joey,we always know what you mean.
喬伊,我們永遠都瞭解你

61
00:04:57,63 --> 00:05:01,12
How long did you think this barbecue would last?
你以為烤肉會維持多久?

62
00:05:01,40 --> 00:05:05,92
-I'm going to China. -Jeez,you say one thing,and....
-我要去中國了 -你說一件事…

63
00:05:06,63 --> 00:05:10,66
-China? -For the museum. Someone found a bone.
-你要去中國? -對,為博物館出差,有人找到骨頭

64
00:05:10,87 --> 00:05:13,07
They don't want us to have it.
我們要骨頭,但他們不想給我們骨頭

65
00:05:13,27 --> 00:05:18,71
I'm going to try to persuade them. It's a whole big bone thing.
因此派我去說服他們給我們骨頭,都是骨頭的事

66
00:05:18,91 --> 00:05:21,31
Anyway,I'll be gone for a week.
總之,我要去一個星期

67
00:05:21,52 --> 00:05:26,82
If you want to reach me,you can't. So here's my itinerary.
你們將連絡不到我,這是我的行程表

68
00:05:27,89 --> 00:05:30,72
-Here's a picture of me. -Oh,let me see.
-這是我的照片. -讓我看

69
00:05:31,23 --> 00:05:36,29
Could you show it to Ben every now and then so he doesn't forget me?
能偶爾拿照片到卡蘿家去給本看? 這樣他就不會忘記我了

70
00:05:36,73 --> 00:05:39,89
"Hi,Ben. I'm your father."
本,我是你爸爸

71
00:05:42,20 --> 00:05:44,36
"I am The Head!"
我是頭

72
00:05:49,78 --> 00:05:52,75
This barbecue's gonna be very fun.
這回烤肉一定很好玩

73
00:05:52,95 --> 00:05:56,64
I wanted to wish Rachel a happy birthday before I left.
瑞秋在嗎?我想在我離開前祝她生日快樂

74
00:05:56,85 --> 00:06:01,75
-She's out having drinks with Carl. -Hey,who's Carl?
-她和卡爾在外面喝酒 -卡爾是誰?

75
00:06:04,46 --> 00:06:06,93
That guy she met at the coffeehouse.
她在咖啡屋認識的那個

76
00:06:07,13 --> 00:06:11,69
-There's this guy she met at -The coffeehouse? Right.
-她在咖啡屋認識的那個? -咖啡屋?是的

77
00:06:11,90 --> 00:06:13,96
So you do know who he is.
這麼說你知道他是誰

78
00:06:17,81 --> 00:06:20,24
I'll go say goodbye to the guys.
我去跟他們道別

79
00:06:20,44 --> 00:06:23,81
Hey,you know what? Tell them that bone story.
告訴他們骨頭的事吧

80
00:06:30,82 --> 00:06:34,15
-I have to go to China. -The country?
-我得到中國(瓷器)一趟 -國家?

81
00:06:35,22 --> 00:06:39,66
No,this big pile of dishes in my mom's breakfront.
不,我媽家中的一大堆盤子

82
00:06:40,50 --> 00:06:42,19
Do you know who Carl is?
你知道卡爾是誰嗎?

83
00:06:42,40 --> 00:06:46,86
Let's see. Alvin,Simon,Theodore.... No.
我想看看,艾文,賽門,希爾朵…不認識

84
00:06:48,24 --> 00:06:50,93
Rachel's having drinks with him tonight.
瑞秋今晚和他在一起喝酒

85
00:06:51,14 --> 00:06:54,77
How can she,when she's never shown interest in you?
不,她還沒對你有任何表示前,怎能這樣做?

86
00:06:55,48 --> 00:06:58,10
-Forget about her. -He's right.
-忘了她吧 -他說得對

87
00:06:58,31 --> 00:07:01,28
Please move on. Go to China. Eat Chinese food.
去吧,到中國,吃中國菜

88
00:07:01,85 --> 00:07:04,91
Of course,there they just call it "food."
當然,他們在那兒只稱為菜

89
00:07:05,12 --> 00:07:08,75
Yeah,I guess. I don't know.
是嗎?大概吧,我也不知道

90
00:07:09,02 --> 00:07:12,58
All right,just give her this for me,okay?
幫我把這個交給她

91
00:07:12,79 --> 00:07:16,39
We're looking out for you. We want you to be happy.
兄弟,我們只是為你著想,我們要你快樂

92
00:07:16,60 --> 00:07:21,09
I may only have a couple beers in me,but I love you.
或許我喝了兩瓶,但我愛你

93
00:07:22,94 --> 00:07:24,87
I'm still on my first.
我只喝了一瓶

94
00:07:27,81 --> 00:07:30,11
I just think you're nice.
我覺得你人真好

95
00:07:36,78 --> 00:07:40,62
That's when we started this fruit basket business.
總之,我和朋友開始水果籃事業後

96
00:07:40,82 --> 00:07:45,42
We call ourselves "The Three Basketeers."
我們就自稱為「三籃人」

97
00:07:45,66 --> 00:07:49,06
Like "The Three Musketeers," only with fruit.
就像「三個火槍手」,只不過是用蔬菜啊

98
00:07:55,40 --> 00:07:58,34
-How do you want your burgers? -Presents first!
-誰想吃漢堡? -不,禮物先

99
00:07:58,54 --> 00:08:01,34
We're doing presents first.
禮物先,待會兒再吃

100
00:08:02,98 --> 00:08:07,07
Hey,hold on there,tiger. How are you holding up?
等等,猛男.進展得如何?

101
00:08:07,28 --> 00:08:11,15
Well,not so good. She thinks tonight we're gonna...
不太順利,她想在今晚

102
00:08:11,35 --> 00:08:15,65
...complete the transaction, if you know what And you do.
就敲定這筆交易,如果你…你懂

103
00:08:15,86 --> 00:08:19,42
Have you ever thought about being there for her?
曾想過要為她著想?

104
00:08:19,89 --> 00:08:21,76
What do you mean?
什麼意思?

105
00:08:25,27 --> 00:08:29,00
You know,just be there for her.
你知道的,只為她著想

106
00:08:30,57 --> 00:08:32,84
Not following you.
不懂

107
00:08:35,98 --> 00:08:38,00
Think about it.
考慮一下

108
00:08:42,25 --> 00:08:48,05
Okay. I'm guessing this is from....
我猜這是…

109
00:08:50,59 --> 00:08:54,15
-Thank you,Melanie. -This one right here is from me.
-謝謝,瑪蓮妮. -這是我送你的

110
00:08:54,36 --> 00:08:59,27
Okay. It's light. It rattles.
好輕,還有聲音

111
00:08:59,50 --> 00:09:00,49
It's...
這是…

112
00:09:02,24 --> 00:09:04,53
...Travel Scrabble!
…是旅遊拼字

113
00:09:07,74 --> 00:09:09,51
Thank you.
謝謝

114
00:09:13,01 --> 00:09:14,64
This one's from Joey.
這是喬伊送的

115
00:09:14,85 --> 00:09:19,65
It feels like a book,I think it's a book. And it's a book!
感覺像是一本書,我猜是一本書,就是一本書啊!

116
00:09:19,85 --> 00:09:21,75
It's Dr. Seuss!
是「蘇博士」

117
00:09:22,89 --> 00:09:26,45
That book got me through some tough times.
那本書讓我度過許多難關

118
00:09:27,03 --> 00:09:29,66
There's a little child inside this man.
這男人裡面有個小孩

119
00:09:29,86 --> 00:09:33,56
The doctors say if they remove it, he'll die.
醫生說把他移走他就會死

120
00:09:35,74 --> 00:09:37,83
-Who's this from? -From Ross.
-這是誰送的? -羅斯送的

121
00:09:43,98 --> 00:09:48,14
Oh,my God! He remembered!
天啊,他記得

122
00:09:48,58 --> 00:09:51,28
-Remembered what? -lt was months ago.
-記得什麼? -幾個月前

123
00:09:51,55 --> 00:09:54,99
We walked by this antique store. I saw this pin.
我們經過一家古董店.我看見這個胸針時

124
00:09:55,26 --> 00:09:59,92
I told him it was like one my grandma had when I was little.
我告訴他我小時候我祖母也有一個

125
00:10:00,16 --> 00:10:02,69
I can't believe he remembered!
沒想到他還記得

126
00:10:02,90 --> 00:10:06,49
Well,sure,but can you play it on a plane?
但你能在飛機上玩嗎?

127
00:10:11,51 --> 00:10:15,37
It's so pretty! This must've cost him a fortune.
-好漂亮 -一定花了他不少錢

128
00:10:15,58 --> 00:10:16,74
I can't believe it.
沒想到他會這麼做

129
00:10:16,94 --> 00:10:19,94
Remember when he fell in love with Carol...
記得大學時代他和卡蘿相戀時

130
00:10:20,15 --> 00:10:23,61
...and bought her that expensive crystal duck?
他送她一隻貴死人的水晶鴨?

131
00:10:24,09 --> 00:10:26,35
What did you just say?
你剛說什麼?

132
00:10:37,90 --> 00:10:39,83
Crystal duck.
水晶鴨

133
00:10:43,57 --> 00:10:49,20
No,no,no. The "love" part?
不,相戀那一部份

134
00:10:55,48 --> 00:11:01,39
-Oh,my God! -Oh,no,no,no.
-天啊! -糟了,糟了

135
00:11:02,29 --> 00:11:07,35
That's good. Just keep rubbing your head. That'll turn back time.
很好,繼續撓你的頭,時間會倒流的

136
00:11:13,63 --> 00:11:17,07
This is unbelievable. I mean,this is unbelievable!
太不可思議了,真是太不可思議了

137
00:11:17,27 --> 00:11:19,90
I know. This is really,really huge.
我知道,這真是太大了

138
00:11:20,11 --> 00:11:24,57
No,it's not. It's small. It's tiny. It's petite. It's wee.
不,它又小又細又霉

139
00:11:24,78 --> 00:11:29,77
I don't think any of our lives will ever be the same ever again.
我認為我們的生活將產生變化

140
00:11:31,05 --> 00:11:33,75
Is there a mute button on this woman?
這女人身上有消音裝置嗎?

141
00:11:33,95 --> 00:11:37,58
I think this is so great. I mean,you and Ross!
我認為這樣很好啊,你和羅斯

142
00:11:37,79 --> 00:11:40,76
-Did you have any idea? -No,none!
-你有感覺嗎? -沒有

143
00:11:40,96 --> 00:11:44,83
My first night in the city, he mentioned asking me out...
我來到紐約的第一夜,他曾提過要約我出去

144
00:11:45,03 --> 00:11:47,02
... but nothing ever happened.
但他後來再沒提過邀我出去

145
00:11:47,23 --> 00:11:50,40
What else did he say? Does he wanna go out?
他還說些什麼?,他想約我出去?

146
00:11:50,60 --> 00:11:53,04
Given that he's in love with you...
如果他愛你愛得無法自拔

147
00:11:53,24 --> 00:11:56,64
... he wouldn't mind getting a cup of coffee.
他大概想和你喝杯咖啡什麼的

148
00:11:57,01 --> 00:12:02,04
Ross? All this time? I've gotta talk to him.
羅斯?這些日子以來?我得找他談談

149
00:12:02,25 --> 00:12:05,22
-He's in China! -The country.
-可他現在中國! -那個國家

150
00:12:08,49 --> 00:12:09,92
Is his flight gone?
她的飛機起飛了嗎?

151
00:12:10,12 --> 00:12:13,18
Yes! He's watching a woman do this:
是的!他正在看一個女人做這個:

152
00:12:13,39 --> 00:12:14,38
He's gone!
他走了!

153
00:12:14,60 --> 00:12:17,29
His flight doesn't leave for 45 minutes.
他的飛機再過45分鐘才會起飛

154
00:12:17,50 --> 00:12:21,40
-What about time difference? -From here to the airport?
-時差呢? -從這兒到機場?

155
00:12:22,60 --> 00:12:25,16
-You'll never make it! -I've gotta try.
-你趕不上的! -我得試試

156
00:12:25,37 --> 00:12:27,36
What'll you say to him?
瑞秋,你要對他說什麼?

157
00:12:27,58 --> 00:12:30,24
-I don't know. -Then you shouldn't go.
-我也不知道 -那麼或許你不該去

158
00:12:30,44 --> 00:12:34,11
Right. If you're gonna break his heart,that can wait.
沒錯,因為你是去傷他的心,不妨再等等

159
00:12:34,42 --> 00:12:36,41
But if it's good,tell him now.
對,但如果是好消息,你得立刻去

160
00:12:36,62 --> 00:12:41,45
-Maybe I'll know when I see him. -All right,does this help?
-或許見到面時我就知道 -這個有幫助嗎?

161
00:12:47,43 --> 00:12:52,76
No. Look,all I know is,I cannot wait a week. This is just too big.
沒有,我只知道我等不了一星期, 這件事太嚴重了

162
00:12:52,97 --> 00:12:57,06
I've just gotta talk to him. Okay,I'll see you later.
我得和他談談,再見了

163
00:12:57,27 --> 00:13:00,93
Rachel,I love you! Deal with me first!
瑞秋,我愛你.先跟我把事情解決

164
00:13:13,49 --> 00:13:14,48
All right.
好吧

165
00:13:19,79 --> 00:13:23,49
-Ross! Excuse me,pardon me. -Your boarding pass?
-羅斯,抱歉 -請出示登機證

166
00:13:23,70 --> 00:13:25,63
I need to talk to my friend.
我沒有,我只是想找我朋友

167
00:13:25,83 --> 00:13:29,77
Sorry,you're not allowed here without a pass.
抱歉,除非有登機證,否則不能進人

168
00:13:29,97 --> 00:13:33,20
He's right there, in the blue jacket! Can l?
他就在那兒,穿藍色夾克

169
00:13:33,41 --> 00:13:35,38
I'm sorry. Federal regulations!
對不起,不行,聯邦法規

170
00:13:35,58 --> 00:13:39,54
Then could you please just give him a message for me?
好吧,能請你傳話給他?

171
00:13:39,85 --> 00:13:43,81
-This is very important. -All right. What's the message?
-這件事非常重要 -好吧,請說

172
00:13:44,89 --> 00:13:46,61
I don't know.
我也不知道

173
00:13:48,56 --> 00:13:53,32
Excuse me,sir! Excuse me,sir? I have a message for you.
抱歉,先生!有人叫我傳話給你

174
00:13:53,56 --> 00:13:57,86
Rachel loved the present. She'll see you when you get back.
是瑞秋!她說她喜歡你送的禮物 你回來後她想見你

175
00:13:58,07 --> 00:13:59,69
What?
什麼?

176
00:14:00,67 --> 00:14:03,80
Toby,I don't know what she's talking about.
桃伊,拜託,我不懂她在說什麼

177
00:14:04,10 --> 00:14:08,44
There's no Rachel. Don't give me that deep freeze.
我不認識瑞秋,別給我臉色看

178
00:14:17,28 --> 00:14:21,74
Oh,Joey,Joey,Joey!
哦,喬伊,喬伊,喬伊!

179
00:14:21,96 --> 00:14:25,55
I think I blacked out there for a minute.
我想我爽昏了啊

180
00:14:26,59 --> 00:14:28,62
It was nothing.
這不算什麼

181
00:14:28,83 --> 00:14:32,82
Well,now we gotta find something fun for you.
現在讓我來伺候你

182
00:14:36,30 --> 00:14:37,77
You know what?
你知道嗎?

183
00:14:39,67 --> 00:14:43,34
Forget about me. Let's give you another turn.
別管我了,我再伺候你一回

184
00:14:45,91 --> 00:14:49,75
-Me,again? -Sure. Why not?
-又是我? -當然,有何不可?

185
00:14:52,35 --> 00:14:58,35
Boy,somebody's gonna get a big fruit basket tomorrow!
明天有人會收到大水果籃!

186
00:15:02,26 --> 00:15:07,39
I gotta tell you,you are nothing like I thought you'd be.
我得告訴你,你不像我想像中的那樣

187
00:15:07,60 --> 00:15:08,97
How do you mean?
什麼意思?

188
00:15:09,17 --> 00:15:13,61
I had you pegged as a guy who's always,"Me,me,me!"
大概是我認為,你是只顧自己享受的人

189
00:15:13,87 --> 00:15:17,07
But you,you're a giver.
但你是個樂於付出的人

190
00:15:18,51 --> 00:15:21,31
You're the most generous man I ever met.
你是我見過最慷慨的人

191
00:15:21,52 --> 00:15:24,54
I mean,you're practically a woman.
你簡直就是個女人

192
00:15:32,49 --> 00:15:35,72
-You're just saying that. -No.
-你剛剛說了那個 -不

193
00:15:37,36 --> 00:15:39,06
A woman!
一個女人

194
00:15:49,91 --> 00:15:52,28
-So? -I missed him.
-所以? -我錯過了

195
00:15:52,48 --> 00:15:54,91
-I'm so sorry. -That's too bad.
-我很抱歉 -這太糟了

196
00:15:55,12 --> 00:15:56,78
Yeah,right.
是的

197
00:15:57,45 --> 00:15:59,54
No,I feel bad for her. I do.
不,我覺得對她不好,我真的這麼認為

198
00:15:59,75 --> 00:16:03,25
I can think of somebody other than myself.
我可以考慮其他人多過考慮我自己

199
00:16:03,46 --> 00:16:05,52
All right,I'm going to bed.
好吧,我要去睡覺了

200
00:16:07,13 --> 00:16:10,53
-Happy birthday. Hang in there. -Thanks.
-生日快樂.保持狀態 -謝謝

201
00:16:11,50 --> 00:16:12,49
Yes!
好啊!

202
00:16:14,90 --> 00:16:16,23
Pizza coupons.
匹薩優惠券

203
00:16:21,21 --> 00:16:25,17
Okay. You guys want help cleaning up this mess?
你們小伙打算幫忙清理這裡嗎?

204
00:16:25,38 --> 00:16:26,94
That'd be great.
不錯

205
00:16:30,25 --> 00:16:33,48
So,Rach,you wanna save this wrapping paper?
瑞秋,這包裝紙要留下來嗎?

206
00:16:33,69 --> 00:16:38,49
Are you gonna go for it with Ross or should I throw it out?
你要為羅斯留下,還是要我丟掉?

207
00:16:41,36 --> 00:16:45,32
I don't know. I don't know.
我不知道,我不知道

208
00:16:45,53 --> 00:16:48,02
Thought about it all the way there...
我左思右想

209
00:16:48,24 --> 00:16:53,14
...and I thought about it all the way back. You know,it's Ross!
我左思右想,你知道的,羅斯

210
00:16:53,34 --> 00:16:55,74
You know what I mean? It's Ross.
你知道什麼我什麼意思?就是羅斯了

211
00:16:55,94 --> 00:16:57,67
-Sure! -Sure.
-當然! -當然

212
00:16:57,88 --> 00:17:03,15
I don't know. This is just my initial gut feeling...
我不知道,這是我內心深處的感受

213
00:17:03,68 --> 00:17:07,71
... but I'm thinking it'd be really great.
我想這樣應該會很不錯

214
00:17:07,92 --> 00:17:11,52
Oh,my God,me too! We'd be like friends-in-law!
天啊,我也是這樣想 這樣我們就成了親戚兼朋友

215
00:17:12,79 --> 00:17:15,96
The best part is you already know all about him.
你知道最棒的是什麼?最棒的就是你已對他瞭如指掌

216
00:17:16,16 --> 00:17:18,29
You start on the 1 5th date.
就好像從第15次約會開始

217
00:17:18,50 --> 00:17:21,90
But it would be like starting on the 1 5th date.
對,但這就像從第15次約會開始

218
00:17:22,80 --> 00:17:24,70
Another good point.
這觀點也不錯

219
00:17:24,91 --> 00:17:29,14
I mean,on the 1 5th date, you're already in a very...
不,在第15次約會時,感情已

220
00:17:29,34 --> 00:17:32,57
... "relationship-y" place. You're committed.
相當深厚,你們已經定下來了

221
00:17:36,08 --> 00:17:38,48
What happens if it doesn't work out?
如果感情破裂該怎麼辦?

222
00:17:38,69 --> 00:17:41,65
-Why isn't it working out? -Sometimes it doesn't.
-為何會感情破裂? -感情是勉強不來的

223
00:17:41,89 --> 00:17:45,62
Is he not cute enough? Does he not make enough money?
你不覺得他帥?他錢賺得不夠多?

224
00:17:45,83 --> 00:17:48,80
-No,I'm just -Maybe there's someone else.
-不,我只是 -或許是另有其人?

225
00:17:49,00 --> 00:17:53,66
-ls there someone else? -No,there is no one else.
-另有其人? -沒有,沒有另有其人

226
00:17:53,87 --> 00:17:56,50
Then why are you dumping my brother?
那麼你為何甩掉我哥?

227
00:18:07,21 --> 00:18:09,91
Hey,big Spender!
大…揮霍者

228
00:18:12,85 --> 00:18:14,41
She's still asleep.
她還在睡覺

229
00:18:14,72 --> 00:18:19,35
-So how'd it go? -You know how you think you're great?
-情況如何? -你有沒有老覺得自己床上功夫不錯?

230
00:18:19,56 --> 00:18:23,59
The fact you'd even ask shows how little you know me.
你會問這種問題,表示你根本不瞭解我

231
00:18:23,80 --> 00:18:28,63
Last night I couldn't do the thing that usually makes me great.
昨晚我不能做讓自己滿足的事

232
00:18:28,84 --> 00:18:31,27
So I had to do all this other stuff.
因此我得搬出全套功夫

233
00:18:31,47 --> 00:18:34,27
And the response I got! Man,oh,man!
結果我得到什麼回應?

234
00:18:34,51 --> 00:18:37,53
It was like a ticker-tape parade!
就像是盛大的遊行

235
00:18:38,61 --> 00:18:43,52
I know. My room's very,very close to the parade route.
我明白,遊行發生時,我的房間就非常接近遊行路線

236
00:18:48,02 --> 00:18:51,62
It was amazing,and not just for her. For me too!
這簡直是太神奇了,而且不只是對她,對我也一樣

237
00:18:51,86 --> 00:18:55,06
It's like,all of a sudden I'm blind...
我就好像突然失明

238
00:18:55,26 --> 00:18:58,06
... but all my other senses are heightened.
但其他的感官卻更加的敏感

239
00:18:58,27 --> 00:19:01,17
It's like I was able to appreciate it...
好像我達到…

240
00:19:01,47 --> 00:19:03,46
...on another level.
…更高的境界

241
00:19:06,04 --> 00:19:10,98
-I didn't know you had another level. -I know. Neither did l!
-我不知道你還有更高的境界. -我懂,我自己也不知道

242
00:19:12,98 --> 00:19:15,92
Is something going on with O.J.?
O.J有活動?

243
00:19:26,33 --> 00:19:28,85
Hey,great skirt. Birthday present?
漂亮的裙子,生日禮物?

244
00:19:29,06 --> 00:19:30,22
-From who? -You.
-誰送的? -你

245
00:19:30,43 --> 00:19:33,13
I exchanged the blouse you got me.
我將你送的襯衫改成的

246
00:19:34,37 --> 00:19:35,96
Well,it's the thought.
真聰明

247
00:19:36,80 --> 00:19:41,17
Doesn't Ross'flight get in in a couple hours? At gate 27B?
羅斯的飛機不是再過幾小時就要抵達?27-b門?

248
00:19:42,71 --> 00:19:47,08
Yeah. Monica,you know,I've been thinking about it.
對,摩尼卡,我一直在想

249
00:19:47,31 --> 00:19:50,58
I've decided this Ross thing is not a good idea.
我雖決定和羅斯在一起,但這樣或許不好

250
00:19:50,78 --> 00:19:51,77
Why?
為什麼?

251
00:19:51,99 --> 00:19:55,58
I feel like I wouldn't just be going out with him.
因為我感覺,我不只是和他出去

252
00:19:55,79 --> 00:19:59,59
I'd be going out with all of you. There'd be pressure
而是和你們大家一起出去,因為壓力…

253
00:19:59,83 --> 00:20:01,62
No pressure,no pressure!
不,沒有壓力.沒有壓力…

254
00:20:03,40 --> 00:20:06,23
Nothing has happened, and you're already so
八字都還沒一撇你就…

255
00:20:06,43 --> 00:20:10,39
I'm not "so." Okay,I was a teensy bit weird at first...
我沒有,開始我也覺得有點奇怪

256
00:20:10,60 --> 00:20:13,73
... but I'll be good. I promise.
但我沒事的,我保證

257
00:20:18,75 --> 00:20:21,27
-Who is it? -It's me,Carl.
-是誰? -是我,卡爾

258
00:20:21,58 --> 00:20:24,38
-Come on up. -Behind my brother's back?
-上來! -背著我哥?

259
00:20:26,25 --> 00:20:31,32
Is the kind of crazy thing you won't be hearing from me.
我就不做出這種瘋狂事

260
00:20:43,37 --> 00:20:46,60
-Seven hundred bucks! -All right,you did it!
-七百塊! -你辦到了!

261
00:20:46,81 --> 00:20:49,11
Do we have any fruit?
我們有水果可吃嗎?

262
00:20:51,38 --> 00:20:53,28
Man,hell of a two weeks.
折騰了兩星期

263
00:20:53,55 --> 00:20:56,48
You know what? I feel I learned something.
我感覺自己學到了一些

264
00:20:56,68 --> 00:20:59,28
You'll stick with this "all for her" thing?
這麼說你將繼續「犧牲小我完成大我」?

265
00:20:59,52 --> 00:21:01,11
What are you,crazy?
你瘋了不成

266
00:21:01,62 --> 00:21:06,72
When a blind man gets his sight back, does he walk around like this?
瞎人重新見光明後會這樣走路嗎?

267
00:21:11,43 --> 00:21:15,13
If I see one more picture of Ed Begley Jr...
我是說如果我再看見艾德貝格拉二世

268
00:21:15,37 --> 00:21:19,86
...in that stupid electric car, I'm gonna shoot myself!
在那電車上,我就舉槍自盡

269
00:21:20,97 --> 00:21:24,84
I'm not against environmental issues,per se...
別誤會我的意思,我個人並不反對環保

270
00:21:25,05 --> 00:21:26,71
...it's just that guy!
只是我討厭那傢伙

271
00:21:27,15 --> 00:21:31,14
I can't believe you'd rather go out with him than me.
我難以相信你跟他約會,而不是跟我

272
00:21:31,59 --> 00:21:34,58
Excuse me,I'm trying to have a date here.
抱歉,我正在約會

273
00:21:35,06 --> 00:21:38,15
Fine. Just stop thinking about me.
行,那就別再想我

274
00:21:40,73 --> 00:21:42,89
Can't do it,can you?
辦不到,對不?

275
00:21:43,66 --> 00:21:46,00
I'm thinking about you. So what?
我想你,那又怎樣?

276
00:21:46,23 --> 00:21:49,40
I don't get it. What do you see in this guy?
我不懂你為何會選上這種人?

277
00:21:50,57 --> 00:21:53,06
Happens to be a very nice guy.
他像是個好男人

278
00:21:53,27 --> 00:21:56,40
I mean,come on,buddy! Get a real car!
老兄,買台真正的車吧

279
00:21:59,35 --> 00:22:03,11
Rachel,come on. Give us a chance.
瑞秋,給我一個機會吧

280
00:22:03,82 --> 00:22:05,41
Ross,it's too hard.
羅斯,太難了

281
00:22:05,62 --> 00:22:10,32
Why,because it'll get weird for everyone else? This is about us.
為什麼?因為大家會感覺不對勁?這是我們兩人的事

282
00:22:10,52 --> 00:22:13,96
I've been in love with you since the ninth grade.
我從九年級開始就愛上你

283
00:22:14,26 --> 00:22:18,96
You're like my best friend. If we broke up,and I lost you
羅斯,你像是我最要好的朋友 我知道如果分手我將失去你

284
00:22:19,17 --> 00:22:20,96
What makes you think that?
不,你為何認為我們會分手?

285
00:22:21,20 --> 00:22:25,50
Have you been involved where you haven't broken up?
曾和你在一起人不是都和你分手了

286
00:22:27,57 --> 00:22:28,56
No.
不

287
00:22:29,41 --> 00:22:33,21
But it only has to happen once.
但這種事只會發生一次

288
00:22:33,48 --> 00:22:38,21
You and I both know we are perfect for each other. Right?
你我都知道我們是天生的一對

289
00:22:38,42 --> 00:22:42,79
So the only question is: Are you attracted to me?
唯一的問題是:你對我有感覺嗎?

290
00:22:43,89 --> 00:22:45,86
I don't know.
我不知道

291
00:22:47,36 --> 00:22:50,33
I mean,I've never looked at you that way before.
我從未以那種方式看你

292
00:22:51,10 --> 00:22:52,73
Well,start looking.
那就開始看吧

293
00:23:03,64 --> 00:23:05,67
-Wow. -Exactly!
-喔. -準確!

294
00:23:05,91 --> 00:23:07,85
And I'm gonna be the guy...
沒錯,我就是那個

295
00:23:08,12 --> 00:23:11,35
...caught behind this hammerhead in traffic!
被困在車陣中的傢伙

296
00:23:13,59 --> 00:23:16,25
Right! You're right.
對…你是對的

297
00:23:17,09 --> 00:23:18,15
You know what?
你知道嗎?

298
00:23:18,36 --> 00:23:21,69
I'm supposed to pick up a friend at the airport.
我本應該去機場接朋友

299
00:23:21,93 --> 00:23:23,95
I am so sorry!
真是抱歉

300
00:23:24,20 --> 00:23:27,39
If you wanna finish your drinks, please do.
如果你想在這兒繼續喝,請便

301
00:23:27,60 --> 00:23:31,09
-I'm sorry,I gotta go. I'm sorry. -But....
-但我得走了,抱歉 -可是

302
00:23:36,44 --> 00:23:39,34
-Where are you going? -To get Ross.
-你要去哪? -去接羅斯

303
00:23:39,55 --> 00:23:41,91
-My God,this is so exciting! -I know.
-天哪,這太令人興奮了! -我知道

304
00:23:42,12 --> 00:23:46,45
If you want the rest of my date, I'm not gonna finish it.
如果你希望和我繼續剩下的約會,我要結束這個

305
00:23:46,92 --> 00:23:52,45
-Rachel,he's not a sandwich. -No,he's a banker with opera tickets.
-瑞秋,他不是三明治. -不,他是一個有劇院的銀行家

306
00:23:53,76 --> 00:23:55,59
Hello!
你好!

307
00:23:59,10 --> 00:24:00,96
-Where you going? -Airport.
-你要去哪? -機場

308
00:24:01,20 --> 00:24:04,53
You can't tell him. There's so much I haven't done.
你不能告訴他,有太多的事情我沒有去做

309
00:24:04,74 --> 00:24:07,71
I haven't watched Baywatch with Yasmine Bleeth!
我還沒有看「海灣女郎」呢!

310
00:24:09,34 --> 00:24:13,28
Chandler,relax. This is a good going to the airport.
錢德,輕鬆點,這是一個好的接機

311
00:24:13,81 --> 00:24:17,51
Oh,well then fly,good woman, fly like the wind.
哦,好吧,飛吧,好女人,像風一樣飛吧

312
00:24:17,72 --> 00:24:20,69
-I'm flying! -Tell him I'm the one who blew it!
-我在飛也! -告訴他是我吹的風!

313
00:24:22,16 --> 00:24:26,92
Yes,another successful case for the love doctor.
好吧,另外一個愛情博士的成功案例

314
00:24:35,24 --> 00:24:38,57
Excuse me! Pardon me. Excuse me. Sorry.
對不起!對不起

315
00:24:39,34 --> 00:24:42,47
Toby,for God's sake, will you let it go?
桃伊,別再胡思亂想了

316
00:24:42,74 --> 00:24:44,21
There's no Rachel!
沒有瑞秋這個人

317
00:24:49,15 --> 00:24:52,08
Hey! I got that.
嘿,我拿到了

318
00:24:52,62 --> 00:24:54,78
-Thanks,sweetie. -No problem.
-謝謝 -不客氣

319
00:25:00,73 --> 00:25:03,46
I can't wait for you to meet my friends.
我迫不及待、想將你介紹給我朋友

320
00:25:03,66 --> 00:25:06,36
You don't think they'll judge me?
你不認為他們會評斷我、取笑我?

